MTD	title	Acyl Carnitines Concentrations in Muscle Tissue of Muscle Wasting in Cancer Cachexia (part-IV)
MTD	description	Acyl Carnitines Concentrations of Muscle Wasting in Cancer Cachexia. Muscle samples from 10 control patients, 10 weight stable pancreatic cancer patients, and 10 pancreatic cancer patients with significant weight loss. Samples are divided evenly between males and females.
